     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Number of public hearings/consultations per year with at least 33% of time allocated for input by citizens that reflects citizen concerns by the National Assembly committees and informal groups; 
2) Percentage of National Assembly publications (e.g. - annual reports, draft laws, amendments, budget analysis) published in a manner that allows for effective public input; 
3) Draft laws and amendments promoting transparency and public participation adopted in the National Assembly; 
4) Number of initiatives for cross-party engagement that promote policy-making based on compromise and/or consensus that have an impact on inclusive development</narrative>
    </description>
